ADDITIONAL DISCLAIMER FOR THIS SOFTWARE

This program modifies Windows system settings: the registry, services,
scheduled tasks, installed packages and network configuration. Such changes
can make an operating system unstable or unbootable, can disable security
features, and can prevent updates from installing.

You run this program entirely at your own risk. The copyright holder is not
responsible for any damage, data loss, downtime, broken installations,
disabled protection, lost licences, or any other consequence of using it,
whether the change was applied by you, by the recommendation wizard, or by a
preset.

The program keeps a journal of every change and can revert them, and it can
create a system restore point beforehand. Neither mechanism is a guarantee.
Back up anything you cannot afford to lose before applying tweaks.

Tweaks marked as high risk deliberately disable protection or updates. By
applying them you accept full responsibility for the resulting state of the
system.
